<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Mantex Q1 net profit off.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Mantex Q1 net profit off.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 286 million bolivars vs 898 million</p>
<p>Net sales 7.1 bln bolivars vs 6.4 bln</p>
<p>Monetary gain 984 million bolivars vs 1.3 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Cost of sales 6.4 bln boivars vs 5.7 bln bolivars</p>
<p>General expenses 707 million bolivars vs 318 million bolivars</p>
<p>Notes: all figures are in inflation-adjusted March 31 1997 bolivars.</p>
<p>Period ends March 31. Results are consolidated first quarter 1997 results versus same period last year.</p>
<p>Mantex SACA is a Venezuelan textile manufacturer.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
